# Apple Silicon, streaming recogniser: Voxtral Mini 4B Realtime (4-bit, MLX) for English/German/French/... sources; other sources (Slovak) use Whisper.
# Needs `pip install --no-deps mlx-audio==0.6.4` in .venv. UNPROVEN through the real route on a 16 GB Mac (2026-11-08: 0.2 s pushes fell 3-6 s behind; the
# 0.64 s push default held <= 0.7 s only in a standalone script). Close other apps first; expect to need a GPU machine (documentation/STATUS.md, "Mac ceiling").
# Pick Speech cutting = "Agreement, short pieces" on the live page. Run: make run PRESET=mac-voxtral
BP_STT_ENGINE=voxtral
BP_SK_STT_MODEL=ct2_models/whisper-large-v3-turbo-sk
BP_PROSODY=1
BP_LOG_SESSIONS=1
# Speech cutting the live page preselects: same as mac
BP_DEFAULT_STRATEGY=agree_short
